# Committed on purpose: nothing here is a key. Vite loads this file for every
# `vite build`, which on Vercel means production AND preview deployments.
#
# The public origin every absolute URL search engines read is built from: canonical
# links, og:url, JSON-LD `url`, and the `Sitemap:` line appended to robots.txt.
# Previews inheriting it is intended — a preview's canonical should point at the
# real site, and Vercel already sends X-Robots-Tag: noindex on preview URLs, so a
# preview can never be indexed in its own right. Must match KASHROOT_PUBLIC_WEB_ORIGIN
# in render.yaml.
VITE_SITE_ORIGIN=https://kashroot.app
